<view class="guide-page">
  <view class="poster-head">
    <view class="poster-kicker">DAFO ANIMAL HOSPITAL</view>
    <view class="poster-title">流浪猫 TNR<text>申请流程</text></view>
    <view class="poster-sub">先看流程，再准备材料，申请会更顺利</view>
    <view class="poster-share">本页可转发给申请人，也可直接截图保存</view>
  </view>

  <view class="prepare-panel">
    <view class="panel-eyebrow">申请前准备</view>
    <view class="prepare-row"><text class="prepare-no">01</text><text>申请人姓名、手机号、身份证号</text></view>
    <view class="prepare-row"><text class="prepare-no">02</text><text>猫咪发现地点和详细地址</text></view>
    <view class="prepare-row highlight"><text class="prepare-no">03</text><text>至少 2 张清晰照片（建议正脸、全身）；视频仅可补充</text></view>
    <view class="prepare-row"><text class="prepare-no">04</text><text>猫咪性别、毛色和健康情况</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="flow-title">申请步骤</view>
  <view class="flow-list">
    <view class="flow-step">
      <view class="step-no">1</view>
      <view class="step-copy"><view class="step-title">开启通知提醒</view><view class="step-desc">用于接收审核、预约和手术进度通知。</view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="flow-step">
      <view class="step-no">2</view>
      <view class="step-copy"><view class="step-title">填写申请资料</view><view class="step-desc">一只猫提交一份申请，资料必须真实、完整。</view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="flow-step important">
      <view class="step-no">3</view>
      <view class="step-copy"><view class="step-title">上传照片和补充视频</view><view class="step-desc">必须上传至少 2 张清晰照片，建议包含正脸和全身；视频可以补充，但不能代替照片。</view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="flow-step">
      <view class="step-no">4</view>
      <view class="step-copy"><view class="step-title">提交并等待医院审核</view><view class="step-desc">提交后，可在“我的 TNR 申请”查看审核进度。</view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="flow-step">
      <view class="step-no">5</view>
      <view class="step-copy"><view class="step-title">审核通过后预约</view><view class="step-desc">按照页面提示选择可预约门店、日期和时间。</view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="flow-step">
      <view class="step-no">6</view>
      <view class="step-copy"><view class="step-title">按通知带猫到院</view><view class="step-desc">不能按时到院，请提前取消预约，避免形成爽约记录。</view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="flow-step">
      <view class="step-no">7</view>
      <view class="step-copy"><view class="step-title">到院核对与身体评估</view><view class="step-desc">医院会核对是否为申请中的猫；是否适合手术，以到院检查为准。</view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="flow-step last">
      <view class="step-no">8</view>
      <view class="step-copy"><view class="step-title">查看手术进度与结果</view><view class="step-desc">后续状态和手术进度，可在“我的 TNR 申请”中查看。</view></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice-panel">
    <view class="notice-title">重要注意事项</view>
    <view class="notice-item">必须是流浪猫，不得用家养猫冒充申请。</view>
    <view class="notice-item">申请人须同意绝育后进行剪耳标记。</view>
    <view class="notice-item">照片或视频要清晰，请勿重复提交同一只猫。</view>
    <view class="notice-item">审核通过不代表一定可以手术，最终以到院身体评估为准。</view>
    <view class="notice-item">无法按时到院请提前取消，爽约会影响后续申请。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="guide-actions">
    <button class="action primary" bindtap="goApply">开始申请</button>
    <button class="action secondary" bindtap="goStatus">查看我的申请</button>
  </view>

  <view class="poster-foot">大风动物医院 · 流浪猫绝育公益申请</view>
</view>
